      "content": "That's a really strange way to describe a train station. \"Goblin stronghold\"? \"Horde of goblins\"? I'm just trying to plan a business trip, not a fantasy novel. Can you just give me the actual, logical layout of the lift system without all the weird metaphors? I need to know if there are any specific physical obstacles I should watch out for.",
